.TH "XmDataFieldGetLastPosition" "library call"
.SH "NAME"
\fBXmDataFieldGetLastPosition\fP \(em A DataField function that accesses the position of the last text character
.iX "XmDataFieldGetLastPosition"
.iX "DataField functions" "XmDataFieldGetLastPosition"
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.PP
.nf
#include <Xm/DataF\&.h>
\fBXmTextPosition \fBXmDataFieldGetLastPosition\fP\fR(
\fBWidget \fBwidget\fR\fR);
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
\fBXmDataFieldGetLastPosition\fP accesses the position of the
last character in the text buffer of the DataField widget\&.
.IP "\fIwidget\fP" 10
Specifies the DataField widget ID
.PP
For a complete definition of DataField and its associated resources, see
\fBXmDataField\fP(3)\&.
.SH "RETURN"
.PP
Returns an \fBXmTextPosition\fR value that indicates the position of the last
character in the text buffer\&. This is an integer number of
characters from the beginning of the buffer\&. The first character
position is 0 (zero)\&.
The last character position is equal to the number of characters
in the text buffer\&.
.SH "RELATED"
.PP
\fBXmDataField\fP(3)\&.
